@startuml schema
title GitLab CI/CD: ODS Documentation Pipeline

start
:Developer pushes to main branch;
note right: Triggers build_all job

:build_all job starts;
note right: Uses ruby-node-antora:2 image + Kroki service

:Ruby scripts generate PDF from .adoc;
note right: tools/start.rb

:Install Node.js dependencies;
note right: npm ci/install

:Run Antora site generation;
note right: antora antora-playbook.yml

:Copy build/site to public/;
note right: if public/ doesn't exist

:Save public/ as artifact;
note right: Save site as artifact

:pages job starts;
note right: Depends on build_all

:Deploy to GitLab Pages;
note right: Site becomes available online

stop

note right
**Release Process (on tag creation):**
1. prepare_release_notes - generates dist/release-notes.adoc
2. release - creates GitLab Release with notes
end note

@enduml